# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mobile / Native（Android、iOS 等：构建缓存、本机配置、安装包）
# 各 app 目录下另有 .gitignore 时以该目录为准；此处为仓库级兜底。
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
**/.cxx/
**/captures/
**/.externalNativeBuild/
# 含 apps/tabtin-electron/resources/tabtin-android.apk：TabPhone 预热用本地包，
# 不入库。需要时从 apps/tabtin-android 打 release 包拷到该路径；缺失则跳过安装。
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.aar
*.ipa
**/*.xcarchive/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/*.dSYM/
**/*.dSYM.zip
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore


